# The granted ability has {T} in its cost, so the creature that has it follows the summoning-sickness rule (CR 302.6,
# 602.5a): the Ornithopter cast and equipped on turn 1 cannot activate it that turn (refused beside the turn-3 activation,
# which works). On turn 3 its targets are artifacts and enchantments only (CR 115.1): Bot2's Island is refused, Sol Ring
# is the control. Paying sacrifices the Hammer and the creature is a 0/2 again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Deconstruction Hammer
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Sol Ring
Island x16

